• 3 years of experience in quality assurance, digital design validation, or digital advertising operations;

• Strong aesthetic sense and exceptional attention to detail (spotting minor visual flaws, alignment issues, or typos);

• Basic technical understanding of HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript (sufficient to inspect and troubleshoot banner code);

• Fluency in Polish and a very good command of English (used daily in internal communication);

• High adaptability and readiness to work productively in a two-shift system and fully remote setup;

• Great communication skills, responsibility, and a problem-solving attitude under tight deadlines.

Nice to have:

• Familiarity with web debugging tools;

• Basic knowledge of graphic software;

• Previous experience in the programmatic, RTB, or digital ad tech industry;

• Interest in using AI tools.

We Offer:&nbsp;

• In-depth training covering internal procedures, technical specifications for banners, and design requirements;

• Opportunity to gain valuable experience in the field of RTB - the fastest-growing, thriving area of online advertising;

• Stable, long-term cooperation based on a B2B contract or contract of mandate;

• Fully remote setup with structured, predictable shift arrangements;

• A crucial role in ensuring the top-tier visual and technical quality of global campaigns for world-class brands;

• Collaboration in a dynamic, tech-driven international environment with a supportive team.

